createTable.description:
Creates a table. Same as creating a form, except:
- field types can only be the column types tables support: `TextArea`, `RadioButton`, `CheckBox`, `BooleanField`, `MobileField`, `NumberField`, `DateTimeField`, `EmailField`, `LinkField`, `AttachmentField`, `FormulaField`, `RelationField`, `SequenceField`;
- attachment columns do not accept limit properties such as count / size limits, and number / formula columns have limited precision; a violation returns 400 listing the offending columns;
- choice columns do not get an "Other" choice; `folder_token` must be a table folder; `layout` is not supported.
- with `with_default_entries: true`, 3 blank entries are added after creation (as when creating a table in the product); by default none are added.
Returns the table structure, including fields and views.
